## How this project is organized

This project follows the [GOTM operating protocol](PROTOCOL.md).

- [`PROTOCOL.md`](PROTOCOL.md) — operating protocol; every agent reads this on session start
- [`LEDGER.md`](LEDGER.md) — canonical list of units; the project's working state
- [`DECISIONS.md`](DECISIONS.md) — append-only log of ratified decisions
- [`QUESTIONS.md`](QUESTIONS.md) — open questions blocking work
- `audits/` — audit outputs (created when audits run)

To work in this project: read `PROTOCOL.md` first.

